o the world of dog betting.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uDmQTc5TV8diEbH1wCJ54RLIMGH.jpg\",\"rating\":9,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"1995-09-14\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Brotherhood\",\"overview\":\"Williams poses as a freshman to investigate a racially motivated killing on a college campus.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mktUi0pWy3ATBceuyK23h1CeyNq.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"1995-09-21\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Digital Underground\",\"overview\":\"Lt. Cooper's daughter ends up missing because of a pedophile she met through email.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/slqdVGYHxidj9vy4mVt1BRvxpnH.jpg\",\"rating\":9,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"1995-09-28\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Buster and Claudia\",\"overview\":\"A string of robberies leads to an ex-con and his girlfriend. Torres tries to settle a dispute between his father and a mobster.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/op3sgpWEyugYfWx33RLHv1ESc9Z.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"1995-10-05\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Student Affairs\",\"overview\":\"Williams and Torres pose as a substitute history teacher and a janitor at the high school where a crime was committed.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/c0p7WDto9jLKz8baWGArD2JMLo4.jpg\",\"rating\":9,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"1995-10-12\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"The Highest Bidder\",\"overview\":\"Moreno poses as a nurse. to solve a newborn's abduction.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mNxPgGvrhcoNNCKfwZzHVGOuHbS.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"1995-10-19\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Young, Beautiful and Dead\",\"overview\":\"Williams poses as a model to investigate the face-slashing of a teen cover girl.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aynDXAtT9nBxOs3h497VBWsd9Ys.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"1995-11-02